<div class="wp-block-group" style="border-bottom-color:#E2E8F0;border-bottom-width:1px;padding-top:28px;padding-bottom:28px"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"18px","fontWeight":"600","letterSpacing":"-0.01em"}}} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading" style="font-size:18px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Do I need to have a specific health condition to work with a nutrition coach?</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->
<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"color":{"text":"#64748B"},"typography":{"fontSize":"15px","lineHeight":"1.65"},"spacing":{"margin":{"top":"0","bottom":"0"}}}} -->
<p class="has-text-color" style="color:#64748B;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65">Not at all. Our clients range from people managing chronic conditions to healthy individuals who simply want to optimise their energy, performance, or body composition. Anyone with a nutrition goal can benefit.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:group {"style":{"border":{"bottom":{"color":"#E2E8F0","width":"1px"}},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"28px","bottom":"28px"},"blockGap":"10px"}},"layout":{"type":"flex","orientation":"vertical"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group" style="border-bottom-color:#E2E8F0;border-bottom-width:1px;padding-top:28px;padding-bottom:28px"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"18px","fontWeight":"600","letterSpacing":"-0.01em"}}} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading" style="font-size:18px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em">How is this different from a generic diet plan I can find online?</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->
<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"color":{"text":"#64748B"},"typography":{"fontSize":"15px","lineHeight":"1.65"},"spacing":{"margin":{"top":"0","bottom":"0"}}}} -->
<p class="has-text-color" style="color:#64748B;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65">Generic plans are built for averages. Our coaches build your plan around your specific bloodwork, food preferences, schedule, budget, cooking ability, and goals. Then they adjust it week by week based on what's actually happening in your life.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:group {"style":{"border":{"bottom":{"color":"#E2E8F0","width":"1px"}},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"28px","bottom":"28px"},"blockGap":"10px"}},"layout":{"type":"flex","orientation":"vertical"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group" style="border-bottom-color:#E2E8F0;border-bottom-width:1px;padding-top:28px;padding-bottom:28px"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"18px","fontWeight":"600","letterSpacing":"-0.01em"}}} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading" style="font-size:18px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em">How are sessions conducted — in person or online?</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->
<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"color":{"text":"#64748B"},"typography":{"fontSize":"15px","lineHeight":"1.65"},"spacing":{"margin":{"top":"0","bottom":"0"}}}} -->
<p class="has-text-color" style="color:#64748B;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65">All coaching sessions are conducted via secure video call, so you can join from anywhere in the world. Between sessions you can message your coach directly through our client portal, powered by AllCoach.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:group {"style":{"border":{"bottom":{"color":"#E2E8F0","width":"1px"}},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"28px","bottom":"28px"},"blockGap":"10px"}},"layout":{"type":"flex","orientation":"vertical"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group" style="border-bottom-color:#E2E8F0;border-bottom-width:1px;padding-top:28px;padding-bottom:28px"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"18px","fontWeight":"600","letterSpacing":"-0.01em"}}} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading" style="font-size:18px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Can I change my coach if we're not a good fit?</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->
<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"color":{"text":"#64748B"},"typography":{"fontSize":"15px","lineHeight":"1.65"},"spacing":{"margin":{"top":"0","bottom":"0"}}}} -->
<p class="has-text-color" style="color:#64748B;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65">Absolutely. If you feel a different coach would be a better match after your first session, just let us know and we'll switch you over at no extra charge. We want you to succeed and that starts with the right partnership.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:group {"style":{"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"28px","bottom":"0"},"blockGap":"10px"}},"layout":{"type":"flex","orientation":"vertical"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group" style="padding-top:28px;padding-bottom:0"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"18px","fontWeight":"600","letterSpacing":"-0.01em"}}} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading" style="font-size:18px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em">What happens if I need to pause or cancel my subscription?</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->
<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"color":{"text":"#64748B"},"typography":{"fontSize":"15px","lineHeight":"1.65"},"spacing":{"margin":{"top":"0","bottom":"0"}}}} -->
<p class="has-text-color" style="color:#64748B;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65">You can pause for up to 30 days or cancel anytime with no penalties. We'll hold your progress data and plan so you can pick up exactly where you left off whenever you're ready to resume.</p>
